                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.918/2: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in the
                        Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-27T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27,
                                1919—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your December 25, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>Please bring with you full text of regulations forbidding publication of false
                    statements against Military and United States Government and articles attempting
                    to disturb order and labor agitation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
